               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your patient, a 35-year-old female, admitted on 15/01/2026 with acute lower abdominal pain and a positive pregnancy test. Transvaginal ultrasound confirmed a right-sided tubal ectopic pregnancy without signs of rupture. Serial serum beta-hCG measurements supported the diagnosis. Given the clinical findings and patient stability, the decision was made for surgical intervention. The patient underwent laparoscopic salpingectomy of the affected fallopian tube with successful removal of the ectopic pregnancy. The postoperative course was uneventful. Analgesic and intravenous fluid therapy were administered during the hospital stay. The patient was discharged in good general condition on 18/01/2026. Outpatient follow-up including beta-hCG monitoring and psychological support is recommended. Please ensure contraceptive counseling and discussion of future fertility options at your earliest convenience.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
